* Gnosis\nConditional Tokens
** Motivation
*** Combinatorial\nprediction markets
*** Nested markets break\nfungibility
*** Order of conditions\nmust not matter
*** Single contract,\ncollateral-agnostic
** Conditions
*** oracle + questionId\n+ outcomeSlotCount
*** conditionId =\nkeccak256 of the three
*** payoutNumerators[]\n+ payoutDenominator
*** prepareCondition
*** reportPayouts\n(sender is the oracle)
** Outcome collections
*** Nonempty proper subset\nof outcome slots
*** Index set = 256-bit\nbitmask
*** Partition = disjoint\nindex sets
** Collection IDs
*** Hash to a point on\nalt_bn128
*** Try-and-increment\non x
*** y from x^3 + 3,\nsqrt by (P+1)/4
*** Compressed to 254 bits\n+ parity flag at bit 254
*** Combined by ecAdd\n(precompile 0x06)
*** Elliptic Curve\nMultiset Hash
** Positions
*** positionId =\nkeccak256(collateral,\ncollectionId)
*** Used as the\nERC-1155 token ID
*** Value = product of\ncollection values
*** Depth = number of\nconditions
** Operations
*** splitPosition\n(burn shallow, mint deep)
*** mergePositions\n(inverse)
*** redeemPositions\n(after resolution)
*** Collateral conservation\ninvariant
** 2019 audit
*** Critical: mint-before-burn\nreentrancy
**** Fixed by burning first
*** Critical: AdHash\ngeneralized birthday
**** Replaced by EC\nmultiset hash
*** Minor: batch mint\ngas savings
** Deployment
*** Mainnet\n0xC59b0e4D...
*** xDai\n0xCeAfDD6b...
*** Solidity ^0.5.1,\nTruffle, LGPL-3.0
*** Reused by Omen\nand Polymarket
